#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-xplane.rst:100
#: 340e6b6446764cb7b3ba6508e7aa9e7c
msgid "Mission Planner is the ground control station we will use to monitor the simulation, control the virtual aircraft's flight modes, load flight routes/missions, etc. More info on it is available `here <https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/mission-planner-overview.html>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-xplane.rst:104
